@startuml
title Reschedule a game
skinparam shadowing false
start
:Administrator selects Reschedule;
:Preload venue, start, and end;
:Submit venue and times without changing teams;
:Route checks Administrator and schema;
:Validate venue and local whole-second times;
:Acquire singleton schedule lock and load game;
if (Season Ongoing and original start still future?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Reject and roll back;
  stop
endif
if (New start is in the future?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Reject and roll back;
  stop
endif
:Check team and venue overlaps, excluding this game;
if (Overlap found?) then (yes)
  :Roll back and return conflict;
else (no)
  :Update venue and times, then commit;
  :Refresh division game list;
endif
stop
legend bottom
  Future checks use the server's local clock.
  Existing teams are retained and their archive status
  is not revalidated.
endlegend
@enduml
